l.a:
Pupils read the words. Then sort them into correct /dr/, /tr/, /bl/, /cl/ and /gl/ boxes.
(e.g. drip and drum go to /dr/ box;
trap and trip go to /tr/ box;
glad, glam and glass go to /gl/ box;
blast and block go to /bl/ box;

